# 换行符策略（强制 LF）
* text=auto eol=lf
*.sh text eol=lf
*.yml text eol=lf
*.md text eol=lf
*.java text eol=lf
*.ts text eol=lf
*.tsx text eol=lf
*.css text eol=lf
*.json text eol=lf
*.sql text eol=lf
*.xml text eol=lf
*.bat text eol=crlf
*.cmd text eol=crlf

# 二进制资源：显式声明，禁止任何换行符转换
# （合并单仓前各子目录自带此段，根级缺失；补齐以保持全仓策略一致）
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.jpeg binary
*.gif binary
*.ico binary
*.woff binary
*.woff2 binary
*.ttf binary
*.pdf binary
*.jar binary
